Attribution and Acknowledgments

This project was developed by Deepak George and is part of the DnA (Deepak's AI) research
and development series. The BIM Layout Verifier leverages concepts from vector embedding,
semantic similarity search, and AI-powered pattern recognition.

Special thanks to:
- The open-source community for foundational libraries and tools
- The BIM and AEC industry for inspiring the verification workflow
- GitHub for providing the hosting platform
- All contributors who help improve this project

Technical Stack
- Python 3.14+
- NumPy for vector operations
- FAISS/Milvus for approximate nearest neighbor search
- Standard library argparse, json, os, pathlib

Project Website
https://github.com/DeepakatDPK/bim-layout-verifier

Contact
Email: deepak.george@example.com
GitHub: https://github.com/DeepakatDPK

